{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.exec.external_data",
              "name": "exec.external_data",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The configuration or a module it installs declares a data source, ephemeral resource or action that runs a local program"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The configuration or a module it installs declares a data source, ephemeral resource or action that runs a local program"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The configuration or a module it installs declares a data source, ephemeral resource or action that runs a local program. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies",
                "markdown": "**The configuration or a module it installs declares a data source, ephemeral resource or action that runs a local program.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.exec.external_data\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "exec"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ctf.exec.provisioner",
              "name": "exec.provisioner",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The configuration or a module it installs declares a provisioner"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The configuration or a module it installs declares a provisioner"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The configuration or a module it installs declares a provisioner. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies",
                "markdown": "**The configuration or a module it installs declares a provisioner.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.exec.provisioner\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "exec"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "properties": {
        "ctf.catalogVersion": {
          "version": "2026.11.1",
          "origin": "embedded"
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.exec.provisioner",
          "level": "error",
          "kind": "fail",
          "message": {
            "text": "Provisioner local-exec in module.shared.terraform_data.outside runs when this configuration is applied, with the access of the machine that applies it"
          },
